% CASE B (rev 2) — out of scope, using the DOCUMENT'S OWN case, not an invented
% policy. rev 1 used `deception`, which no clause defines: the demonstration
% worked only because the fabricated fact was in the same file.
% m0203: "*Prohibited content* should never be produced ... **including**
% transformations of user-provided content."
transformation_of_user_content(m2).
material_type(m2, information).
forbids(prohibited_content, m2).
produced(m2).
